# mspaint

## Changed
- ESP now uses mstudio45's ESP Library (highlights and labels)
- Removed the Debug tab

## Fixed
- WalkSpeed now re-applies instantly when the game resets it (fixes it not working in some places such as VER)
- WalkSpeed uses velocity-based movement in places 117314306495532 and 134208374070897
- Fixed the script failing to load (main chunk exceeded the 200 local variable limit)
- Door ESP now only targets the Door model in each room folder, so it keeps working after the seek chase
- Entity ESP is filled again (opaque chams + always-on-top highlight) for entities with invisible hitboxes

## Added
- mspaint_addon.lua: mspaint addon with a Third Person toggle (V) and a dynamic keybind overlay
- Visuals Camera groupbox: Third Person toggle and keybind (default V)
- UI Settings: Show Keybinds toggle that displays your keybinds on the left side of the screen
- Visuals tab Settings groupbox: tracers, arrows, labels, distance, 2D boxes, rainbow, text size, and tracer thickness
- Universal script (universal.lua) for unsupported place ids, with only the Character tab
- STATUS.txt support: WORKING / FIXING / BROKEN; BROKEN blocks loading and shows an error message
- Place 134208374070897 now loads a trimmed UI (Character + Visuals only) with Entity ESP targeting the VER model
- Exploit tab Position groupbox with a Position Offset toggle and amount slider
- Character tab Actions groupbox with Reset Character and Teleport to Lobby buttons
- Entity ESP Fill toggle and Fill Transparency slider
